# lazytui gallery (holyc/lazytui) - mouse + keys, private HOME
Size 110x34
Theme dracula
Title "lazytui demo"
Slide "lazytui" "a tiny C TUI toolkit" 1500ms
Run $AUTODEMO_ROOT/bin/demo
Sleep 1500ms
Caption "Widgets driven by data + events" bottom
MouseMove 10 5 700ms
Sleep 800ms
SendKey Tab
Sleep 1s
SendKey Tab
Sleep 1s
Caption "Mouse works too" top
MouseMove 30 12 600ms
MouseClick
Sleep 800ms
SendKey q
Sleep 300ms
Loop
